://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250117900488"},{"id":"D23","kind":"DART 공시","title":"감자완료","date":"2025-01-03","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250103900685"},{"id":"D24","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주권매매거래정지 (주식의 병합, 분할 등 전자등록 변경, 말소)","date":"2024-12-17","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241217900588"},{"id":"D25","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주권매매거래정지 (자본감소)","date":"2024-10-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241030900367"},{"id":"D26","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(감자결정)","date":"2024-10-30","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241030000245"},{"id":"D27","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득 (제7회차)","date":"2024-09-19","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240919900308"},{"id":"D28","kind":"DART 공시","title":"전환사채(해외전환사채포함)발행후만기전사채취득 (제7회차)","date":"2024-08-14","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240814901142"},{"id":"D29","kind":"DART 공시","title":"증권발행결과(자율공시) (제3자배정 유상증자)","date":"2024-06-19","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240619900516"},{"id":"D30","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(유상증자결정)","date":"2024-06-11","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240611000360"},{"id":"D31","kind":"DART 공시","title":"증권발행결과(자율공시)(주주우선공모 유상증자)","date":"2023-12-14","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231214901314"},{"id":"D32","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주권매매거래정지(불성실공시법인 지정)","date":"2023-10-26","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231026900741"},{"id":"D33","kind":"DART 공시","title":"불성실공시법인지정(공시변경 1건, 공시번복 3건)","date":"2023-10-26","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231026900740"},{"id":"D34","kind":"DART 공시","title":"불성실공시법인지정예고(공시번복 2건)","date":"2023-09-20","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230920900590"},{"id":"D35","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주권매매거래정지(무상증자)","date":"2023-09-15","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230915900564"},{"id":"D36","kind":"DART 공시","title":"불성실공시법인지정예고(공시번복 1건, 공시변경 1건)","date":"2023-09-13","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230913900513"},{"id":"D37","kind":"DART 공시","title":"최대주주변경을수반하는주식양수도계약해제ㆍ취소등","date":"2023-08-21","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230821900462"},{"id":"D38","kind":"DART 공시","title":"최대주주변경을수반하는주식양수도계약체결","date":"2023-07-03","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230703900573"},{"id":"D39","kind":"DART 공시","title":"대표이사변경","date":"2023-02-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230208900459"},{"id":"D40","kind":"DART 공시","title":"최대주주변경","date":"2023-02-06","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230206900758"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-20","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250320000966"}]}